    of GithubMeta — repository/bugtracker/homepage derived offline from the git
    remote, no API token). For dists with no GitHub remote, the bundle emits
    this META when the remote host is a known Gitea host (codeberg.org and the
    author's own instance) or when the new "gitea = 1" bundle option is set
    (for any other self-hosted Gitea/Forgejo). Purely additive: GitHub-hosted
